Dialogue: 50,0:01:32.20,0:01:33.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ¡¿Qué?!\N– ¡¿Qué?!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:33.78,0:01:36.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Ese Vegapunk?!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.24,0:01:38.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You guys are so noisy...-OG}Dejen de hacer escándalo.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:40.29,0:01:41.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I respect you!-OG}¡Le tengo muchísimo respeto!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.13,0:01:48.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I spent...-OG}¡Pasé dos años enteros...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:49.42,0:01:51.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{two years at the lab in your home...-OG}...en su pueblo natal, Bulgemore...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:52.59,0:01:54.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Baldimore!-OG}...trasteando en su laboratorio!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.14,0:02:00.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{There are so many things\Nthat I wanna show you!-OG}¡Tengo tantas cosas que mostrarle!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.93,0:02:02.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Oye!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.06,0:02:07.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{My dream...-OG}¡Es el robot gigante...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.61,0:02:09.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{giant robot!-OG}...de mis sueños!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.65,0:02:13.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I wonder how many times bigger\Nthan General Franky it is?-OG}Me pregunto cuántas veces más grande que el Franky Shogun será.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.61,0:02:16.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I wish Luffy and Chopper were here to see it!-OG}¡Vaya, Luffy y Chopper se lo pierden!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.91,0:02:20.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Vegapunk is a beautiful lady!-OG}¡Vegapunk es una belleza!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.20,0:02:22.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Let me see your panties!-OG}¡Por favor, déjeme ver sus bragas!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.37,0:02:24.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Linda!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.37,0:02:24.83,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Bragas!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.83,0:02:27.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A giant robot!-OG}¡Robot gigante!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.34,0:02:29.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Súper!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.55,0:02:30.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Esperen!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.05,0:02:33.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Qué pasa, Robin?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.88,0:02:36.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I've never heard of Vegapunk...-OG}Jamás escuché que Vegapunk...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.84,0:02:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{being a woman.-OG}...fuera una mujer.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.18,0:02:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Of course not!-OG}¡Y con razón!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.60,0:02:41.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{There's no way I'm Stella!-OG}¡Obviamente no soy Stella!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.06,0:02:43.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Stella?-OG}¿Stella?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.44,0:02:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soy Punk-02,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.48,0:02:49.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Vegapunk "Lilith"!-OG}¡Vegapunk Lilith!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.49,0:02:54.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Lilith?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.67,0:02:55.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Punk-02?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.28,0:02:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Siempre andamos cortos de presupuesto!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.28,0:03:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Hand over your valuables!-OG}¡Entreguen sus tesoros!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.91,0:03:03.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Then I'll be done with you guys!-OG}¡Luego podrán irse en paz!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.37,0:03:04.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.37,0:03:07.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What are you talking about?!\NThe sea is freezing here!-OG}¡¿De qué hablas?!\N¡Este mar está helado!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.13,0:03:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You saved us from drowning\Nso follow through!-OG}¡Si vas a salvarnos,\Ndebes hacerlo bien!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.46,0:03:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡No era mi intención salvarlos!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.05,0:03:17.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It is essentially impossible\Nfor a ship to enter this area!-OG}¡Se supone que ningún barco\Npuede entrar a estas aguas!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.05,0:03:21.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If you try, these guys will sink\Nyou and you'll be dead!-OG}¡Tenemos seguridad instalada\Npara hundir a los intrusos!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.03,0:03:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{These...-OG}¡Estas son...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.99,0:03:42.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...las Bestias Marinas Armadas!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.87,0:03:44.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Bestias Marinas Armadas?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.95,0:03:46.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Cool!-OG}¡Increíble!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.08,0:03:47.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Now I'm scared more than excited!-OG}¡Olvídalo, ya me harté!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.58,0:03:48.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Oh, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.38,0:03:50.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.01,0:03:56.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If you don't wanna get sunk,-OG}¡Si no quieren que los hundan,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.67,0:03:57.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sólo...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.88,0:03:59.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{hand over your valuables!-OG}...entreguen sus tesoros!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.18,0:04:03.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Okay!-OG}¡Sí, señora!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.35,0:04:07.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}¡Oye, Lilith!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.73,0:04:09.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}¿Qué estás haciendo?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.40,0:04:12.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Shaka! Shut up! I'm just\Ndoing what I do always!-OG}¡Cállate, Shaka!\N¡Sólo hago lo que siempre hago!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.11,0:04:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}¡¿Saqueando otra vez?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.90,0:04:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}¡Ten algo de orgullo como científica!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.07,0:04:18.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Pride won't get me more budget!-OG}¡El orgullo no financia investigaciones!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.36,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Con quién habla?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Don't get all high and mighty on me!-OG}¡No te pongas a darme sermones!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.74,0:04:25.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No se rendirán.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.20,0:04:26.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They're the Straw Hats.-OG}Son los Sombrero de Paja.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.87,0:04:29.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Their captain just became\Nan Emperor of the Sea.-OG}Acaban de nombrar Yonkou a su capitán.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}¡Lo sé!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.42,0:04:34.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{An Emperor must have tons of treasure!-OG}¡Un Yonkou debe estar forrado en tesoros!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.34,0:04:37.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If that's what you want, you made a mistake.-OG}En ese caso, cometiste un grave error.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.84,0:04:39.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A mistake?-OG}¿Un error?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.68,0:04:42.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I tactically surrounded them\Nwith the Sea Beasts!-OG}¡Las bestias marinas los tienen rodeados!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.43,0:04:43.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡No tienen escapatoria!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.51,0:04:46.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, los subestimaste.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.47,0:04:48.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mira al espadachín del barco.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.56,0:04:56.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Es el Cazador de Piratas Zoro,\Nun hombre que vale 1.111 millones de bellies.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.03,0:05:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Está tranquilo porque sabe que puede\Nmatarte en un instante desde ahí.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.32,0:05:06.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lo mismo va para la mujer detrás suyo,\Nla Hija del Demonio Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.16,0:05:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}¡¿Y cómo demonios podrían vencer\Na tantas Bestias Marinas Armadas?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.50,0:05:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The strong figure out who\Nthey need to take down first!-OG}Los fuertes deducen\Nqué objetivos priorizar.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.63,0:05:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tú eres quien está en problemas.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Those noisy fools...-OG}¡¿Así que esos mocosos...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...son señuelos?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.17,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– ¡Genial!\N– ¡Genial!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.55,0:05:21.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I dropped my guard!-OG}¡Bajé la guardia!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.76,0:05:24.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Oye, Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.05,0:05:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I need you to agree with our demands...-OG}Tenemos algunas demandas\Nque vas a cumplir...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.31,0:05:29.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Okay?-OG}¿Entendido?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.52,0:05:33.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A-Are you threatening me?!-OG}¡¿I-Intentas amenazarme?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.27,0:05:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Está bien.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.27,0:05:35.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tráelos.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.52,0:05:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'm interested in that group.-OG}Esa tripulación me interesa.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.74,0:05:46.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Have you ever been here before?-OG}¿Has estado aquí antes?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.53,0:05:48.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, when I was a child.\NIt was just an ordinary lab back then.-OG}Sí, cuando era niña.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En ese entonces, era un laboratorio normal.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.72,0:05:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{And what did you come back for?-OG}¿Y por qué volviste?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.29,0:05:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dijiste que tenías asuntos con Vegapunk...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.04,0:05:58.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Dependiendo de su respuesta,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.71,0:06:00.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I may kill him!-OG}tal vez tenga que matarlo!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.05,0:06:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Wait!-OG}¡Espera un segundo!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.60,0:06:07.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué pasó?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.68,0:06:09.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{My father...-OG}Mi papá...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.60,0:06:12.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{was turned into a cyborg by Vegapunk.-OG}Vegapunk lo convirtió en un cyborg.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.56,0:06:14.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A cyborg?! That's cool!-OG}¡¿Un cyborg?! ¡Qué genial!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.73,0:06:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Vete al diablo!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.15,0:06:21.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He lost all sense of himself now...-OG}A estas alturas, perdió toda su humanidad...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.65,0:06:24.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{and doesn't even know who he is...-OG}Ni siquiera sabe quién es...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.82,0:06:29.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He became nothing more than a living weapon.-OG}Se convirtió en una simple arma viviente.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.83,0:06:32.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Gee! That's quite disturbing...-OG}Eso es horrible...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.87,0:06:36.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, I'll make him pay for it.-OG}Lo es, y se lo haré pagar.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.71,0:06:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'm sorry, Bogey!-OG}¡Lo siento mucho, Bogey!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.38,0:06:41.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Bonney!-OG}¡Bo-nn-ey!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.01,0:06:43.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Lo siento, Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Just shut up and climb!-WF}¡Sólo suban!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.14,0:06:48.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I think we can get to the surface.-OG}Creo que podemos llegar a la superficie desde aquí.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.60,0:06:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Bien!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.10,0:06:56.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Oh! ¡Ya casi llegamos!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.98,0:06:58.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I can't wait!-OG}¡Qué emoción!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.56,0:07:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Comida, allá voy!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.74,0:07:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Llegamos a la superficie!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.99,0:07:14.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{All right! Let's find food–-OG}Bien, busquemos comi...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.83,0:07:17.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Luffy! What's out there?!-OG}¡Luffy! ¿Qué viste?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.04,0:07:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'll come with you!-OG}¡Voy contigo!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.34,0:07:20.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Ah, sí!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.46,0:07:22.84,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{I saw Sabo at Mary Geoise.-OG}Vi a Sabo en Mary Geoise.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.84,0:07:23.97,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{Oh well.-OG}Bueno, no importa ahora.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.27,0:07:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué es todo esto?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.28,0:07:47.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Un robot gigante?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What is all this?!-OG}¿Qué demonios...?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.03,0:07:50.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Un monstruo espacial?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.53,0:07:52.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Hay muchas cosas volando!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.83,0:07:55.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Cool!-OG}¡Increíble!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Bien! ¡Voy a montar esa cosa!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.67,0:08:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Luffy! ¡Ten cuidado!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.50,0:08:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Oye! ¡Somos intrusos!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:05.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}¡Gomu Gomu no...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.76,0:08:07.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Rocket!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.01,0:08:05.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Escúchame!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.89,0:08:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Luffy got swallowed!-OG}¡Esa cosa se comió a Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.45,0:08:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Estás bien, Luffy?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.91,0:08:33.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Huh? I thought I was swallowed...-OG}¿Eh? Creí que me habían comido...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.58,0:08:38.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Un parfait gigante!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.87,0:08:41.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Comida!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.25,0:08:43.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Galletas y frutas!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.50,0:08:45.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Oye! ¡¿A dónde van?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.09,0:08:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It must be a trap!-OG}¡Tiene que ser una trampa!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.55,0:08:46.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1183,1053)}¡Parfait!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.59,0:08:46.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(759,1053)}¡Parfait!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.63,0:08:46.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(522,1053)}¡Parfait!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.67,0:08:46.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(377,1053)}¡Parfait!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.71,0:08:46.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307,1053)}¡Parfait!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.76,0:08:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(288,1053)}¡Parfait!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.63,0:08:47.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1644.5,1053)}¡Comida!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.67,0:08:47.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1367.5,1053)}¡Comida!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.72,0:08:47.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1199.5,1053)}¡Comida!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.76,0:08:47.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1091.5,1053)}¡Comida!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.80,0:08:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1027.5,1053)}¡Comida!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.84,0:08:47.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(991.5,1053)}¡Comida!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.88,0:08:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(980.5,1053)}¡Comida!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.51,0:08:48.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(2002,1053)}¡Mucha crema!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.55,0:08:48.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1844,1053)}¡Mucha crema!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.59,0:08:48.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1752,1053)}¡Mucha crema!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.63,0:08:48.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1692,1053)}¡Mucha crema!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.67,0:08:48.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1654,1053)}¡Mucha crema!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.72,0:08:48.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1636,1053)}¡Mucha crema!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.76,0:08:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1630,1053)}¡Mucha crema!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.68,0:08:58.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'll dig in!-OG}– ¡A comer!\N– ¡A comer!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.90,0:09:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{– What's going on?!\N– What's going on?!-OG}– ¡¿Qué demonios?!\N– ¡¿Qué demonios?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.32,0:09:09.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What?! My hands passed through!-OG}¡¿Qué?! ¡Mis manos lo atraviesan!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.49,0:09:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué es esto?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.53,0:09:13.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's there but I can't touch it!-OG}¡Está ahí, pero no puedo agarrarlo!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.28,0:09:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It makes me even more hungry!-OG}¡Me está dando más hambre!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.62,0:09:18.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡No puedo comerlo!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.92,0:09:22.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No me digas que...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.46,0:09:23.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué?! ¡Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.88,0:09:27.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Acaso morimos sin darnos cuenta?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.05,0:09:30.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,941)}¡¿Estamos muertos?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.18,0:09:33.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Espera un minuto, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.68,0:09:36.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Cállate! ¡Estoy muerto!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.06,0:09:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{There's no way you are!-OG}¡No estás muerto!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.81,0:09:40.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Entonces, ¿por qué pasa esto?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.18,0:09:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No es porque seamos fantasmas.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.94,0:09:44.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parece que...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.15,0:09:47.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I thought so...-OG}Tal como pensé...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.49,0:09:51.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Este parfait es un holograma.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.74,0:09:53.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Holoholo?-OG}¿Holo-holo...?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.57,0:09:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,227)}¡¿Entonces no hay comida?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.45,0:10:00.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{There's no way they keep\Nfood here that conveniently.-OG}Era imposible que dejaran comida\Nasí como así a la intemperie.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.45,0:10:03.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I've never seen a hologram before.-OG}Aun así, es mi primera vez viendo un holograma.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.12,0:10:05.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I can't believe it! It's unforgivable!-OG}¡¿Qué demonios?! ¡Me las pagarán!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.67,0:10:08.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Una imagen tridimensional producida por luz.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.42,0:10:11.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's like something out of\Na comic strip or fantasy.-OG}Es como algo sacado de un\Ncómic o de un mundo de fantasía.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.55,0:10:12.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Una imagen?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.80,0:10:16.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's why I passed through\Nthat space monster!-OG}¡Con razón atravesé\Nese monstruo espacial!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.93,0:10:19.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That giant robot must be a hologram, too.-OG}Ese robot gigante también debe ser un holograma.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.18,0:10:21.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{No one can make something like that.-OG}Después de todo, nadie podría\Nhacer algo como eso.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.18,0:10:23.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Oye!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Look at this!-OG}¡Miren esto!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.65,0:10:25.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What's this?-OG}¿Qué podría ser?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.19,0:10:29.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{There are pictures of food and buttons.-OG}Hay botones con dibujos de comida.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.61,0:10:32.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Didn't you just see it?-OG}¿No prestaste atención?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.19,0:10:34.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Forget it. Everything's fake on this island.-OG}Olvídalo. Todo en esta isla es falso.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.62,0:10:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I just noticed this place is so warm even though\Nthe sea around here was extremely cold.-OG}Acabo de notarlo...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.59,0:10:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aunque el mar estaba helado,\Neste lugar es bastante cálido.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.00,0:10:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Yeah.-OG}Correcto.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.87,0:10:45.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{This is a tropical island.-OG}Aunque parezca tropical,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.96,0:10:49.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{This is undoubtedly a Winter Island though.-OG}esta es sin duda una isla de invierno.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.96,0:10:54.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The reason this place is warm\Nis due to the Island A.C. I created.-OG}Este clima cálido es gracias a mi sistema de aire acondicionado insular.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.09,0:10:58.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'm controlling the temperature\Nof the island itself from its soil.-OG}Controlo la temperatura de la isla\Ndesde la misma tierra.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.06,0:11:03.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You bastards don't look familiar to me...-OG}No creo haberlos visto antes...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.02,0:11:11.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{She's bigger than Kaido.-OG}¡Es incluso más grande que Kaidou!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.02,0:11:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Though I don't know who you are,\Nthe temperature's comfy here, so stick around.-OG}¡Bueno, no importa!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.38,0:11:16.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aquí se está muy calentito, así que quédense.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.21,0:11:18.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Voy de camino al trabajo, así que...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.24,0:11:19.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{let me through.-OG}¡Ya me voy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Hey, big one!-OG}¡Oye, grandulona!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.95,0:11:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Tengo hambre!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.58,0:11:26.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Tú hiciste ese parfait falso, verdad?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.75,0:11:28.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, si tienen hambre...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.71,0:11:31.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Tú también debes ser un holo-holo!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.01,0:11:35.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What? I hit her! Is she real?!-OG}¡¿Qué?! ¡La golpeé! ¡¿Es real?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.17,0:11:39.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué es eso de "la golpeé, es real"?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.14,0:11:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What are you doing, you idiot?!-OG}¡¿Qué estás haciendo, idiota?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.51,0:11:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Sorry!-OG}Lo siento...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.94,0:11:48.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Oh, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.06,0:11:49.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{She's real!-OG}¡Definitivamente es real!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.82,0:11:59.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Qué?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.99,0:12:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Qué?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.41,0:12:05.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Qué?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.42,0:12:14.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Esta textura... Este olor...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.80,0:12:18.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A hamburger served with a drink and fries!-OG}¡Un combo de hamburguesa con papas fritas y refresco!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.72,0:12:19.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ¡¿Es real?!\N– ¡¿Es real?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.72,0:12:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿No es un holo-holo?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.22,0:12:22.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Puedo tocarlo?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.10,0:12:22.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Puedo comerlo?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.81,0:12:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{– Yum!\N– Yum!-OG}– ¡Qué rico!\N– ¡Qué rico!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.98,0:12:30.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{This is real!-OG}¡Es totalmente real!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.56,0:12:34.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What? Who made it?!-OG}Espera... ¡¿Quién lo hizo?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.40,0:12:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿No fue esta cosa?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.86,0:12:37.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No es una persona...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.15,0:12:39.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He pushed the button and it came out.-OG}...pero pulsó el botón y salió.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.41,0:12:41.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Whatever, as long as we can\Nget food! Push the next one!-OG}Mientras podamos conseguir comida, ¡¿qué más da?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Presiona el siguiente!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.28,0:12:43.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{All right!-OG}¡Bien!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.33,0:12:45.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Steak! Omelet with rice! Pork cutlet!-OG}¡Bistec! ¡Tortilla de arroz! ¡Chuleta de cerdo!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.54,0:12:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{– Yum!\N– Yum!-OG}– ¡Qué rico!\N– ¡Qué rico!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Next!-OG}¡Siguiente, siguiente!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.21,0:12:53.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Pastel y algodón de azúcar!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.38,0:12:54.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡No, pizza!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.38,0:12:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'll choose first!-OG}¡Yo primero!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.50,0:12:57.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Ramen, pollo frito y un hot dog!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.63,0:12:58.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Wait! If you push them at once,\Nthey might all be served at once!-OG}¡Espera!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.19,0:13:00.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Wait! If you push them at once,\Nthey might all be served at once!-OG}¡Si los presionas todos,\Ntal vez salgan a la vez!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.72,0:13:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You're smart!-OG}¡Eres un genio!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.80,0:13:03.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You're smart, Chopper!-OG}¡Bien pensado, Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.60,0:13:05.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Your compliment doesn't make me happy!-OG}¡Tus halagos no me hacen feliz, idiota!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.97,0:13:07.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Jinbe, choose one too!-OG}¡Elige algo, Jinbe!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.27,0:13:08.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'm okay.-OG}Estoy bien, gracias.
