Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.65,0:13:19.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Wow, you eat a lot.-OG}Vaya, sí que comes mucho.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.36,0:13:22.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Of course! I was hungry the whole time!-OG}¡Pues claro! ¡Me moría de hambre!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.28,0:13:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Yo también!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.28,0:13:25.62,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Yo también!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.62,0:13:28.37,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{This too!-OG}¡Prueba esto!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.37,0:13:30.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'm glad that they like it.-OG}Me alegra que les guste.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.75,0:13:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Qué está pasando?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.08,0:13:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What is that thing?-OG}¿Qué es ese aparato?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.33,0:13:35.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Do you wanna know?-OG}¿Tienen curiosidad?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.42,0:13:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's an Automated Cooking Machine!-OG}¡Es mi máquina de cocina automática!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.80,0:13:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{As long as there are ingredients, it can\Nprepare 500 different dishes within a minute!-OG}¡Mientras haya ingredientes,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.76,0:13:44.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,puede preparar cualquiera de sus\N500 platos en menos de un minuto!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.72,0:13:48.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The leftover ingredients\Nauto mode is particularly handy!-OG}¡El modo de "sobras rápidas"\Nes particularmente útil!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.77,0:13:54.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If only we could build it\Naccording to the blueprints!-OG}¡Si estuviera construida\Nsegún los planos, claro!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.40,0:13:58.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(435,0)}¡Pero nos faltan técnicos para producirla en masa!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.36,0:13:59.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The island A.C. is the same.-OG}Lo mismo pasa con el aire\Nacondicionado insular.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.86,0:14:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If we can control the temperature\Nof the whole island,-OG}¡Si pudiéramos controlar la\Ntemperatura de toda una isla,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.49,0:14:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{we can also pinpoint all living creatures on it.-OG}entonces podríamos monitorear los\Nsignos vitales de cada organismo!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.74,0:14:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I've invented such a wonderful thing,-OG}¡Hice inventos increíbles,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.54,0:14:13.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{but the circumstances around me\Nhaven't kept up with the value!-OG}pero la falta de fondos no me permite aprovechar su potencial!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.42,0:14:18.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If I had more money to spend, I could even control the weather!-OG}¡Si tuviéramos el dinero,\Nincluso podríamos controlar el clima!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.09,0:14:19.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The world lacks technology and funds!-OG}¡Al mundo le falta tecnología!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.73,0:14:20.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The world lacks technology and funds!-OG}¡Necesito más fondos!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.84,0:14:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'm working so hard to invent\Nthings, why is this happening?!-OG}¡Trabajo tan duro inventando cosas,\N¿por qué me pasa esto?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.14,0:14:28.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Dammit!-OG}¡No jueguen conmigo!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.22,0:14:32.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡No hay suficientes recursos!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.81,0:14:38.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Golpeó un holograma!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.02,0:14:39.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Camarones fritos!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.27,0:14:40.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Waffles!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.36,0:14:46.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I feel better!-OG}¡Mucho mejor!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.49,0:14:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{How's that possible?-OG}¿Cómo es posible?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.95,0:14:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Cómo golpeaste un holograma?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.37,0:14:54.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Do you wanna know? I'll tell you.-OG}¿Tienen curiosidad? Permítanme explicarles.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.79,0:14:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Con estos guantes de presión luminosa,\Nla luz deja de ser sólo algo que se ve.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.59,0:15:02.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Hola!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.72,0:15:08.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{People perceive something\Nas an object when you touch it.-OG}Cuando tocas algo, lo percibes como un objeto sólido, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.18,0:15:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What? So she isn't real?-OG}¿Qué? ¿Entonces no es real?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.14,0:15:11.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Real?-OG}¿No es real?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.10,0:15:15.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Luffy! Look up!-OG}¡Luffy, mira!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.48,0:15:22.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{So she wasn't real.-OG}Entonces no era real...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.36,0:15:24.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I thought she was real.-OG}¡Estaba seguro de que lo era...!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.99,0:15:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Don't ask me if something is real or not!-OG}¡Dejen de preguntar qué es real y qué no!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.24,0:15:30.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You decide what's real and what's not!-OG}¡Decídanlo ustedes mismos!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.37,0:15:34.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Even the word "real" is\Nan old-fashioned concept to me!-OG}¡En lo que a mí respecta,\Nese concepto es una reliquia del pasado!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.33,0:15:36.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{This is yummy!-OG}¡Qué rico!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.08,0:15:37.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You aren't listening!-OG}¡Ni siquiera están escuchando!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.54,0:15:40.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Who in the world are you?-OG}¿Quién demonios eres?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.21,0:15:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Yo?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.76,0:15:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Sólo soy...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.17,0:15:47.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2026,2485,1,\c&H000000&)}...una científica genio que trabaja a sueldo!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.64,0:15:54.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Soy el Doctor Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.48,0:16:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Qué rico!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.94,0:16:04.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}¡¿Tú eres el Doctor Vegapunk?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Koby told me about you!-OG}¡Koby me habló mucho sobre ti!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.36,0:16:08.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You're too big and too young!-OG}¡Eres muy grande! ¡Y muy joven!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.61,0:16:10.03,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{No way!-OG}¡Es mentira!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.03,0:16:11.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,¿De qué está hablando?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.12,0:16:19.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{So what should we do?-OG}Entonces, ¿cuál es el plan?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.29,0:16:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Escucha. Sólo hay un Vegapunk en el mundo,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.96,0:16:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{But he's so busy because he's a genius.-OG}pero como es un genio,\Nsiempre está muy ocupado.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.59,0:16:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He doesn't have enough time. He'll take all the help he can get.-OG}Le falta tanto el tiempo que\Nacepta toda la ayuda que puede.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.30,0:16:33.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Then he came up with an idea...-OG}Entonces se le ocurrió...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.51,0:16:36.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{to split himself into six.-OG}"¿Qué pasaría si me divido en seis cuerpos?"
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.85,0:16:40.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Those offshoots are called Satellites.-OG}A esas divisiones las llama satélites.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.15,0:16:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En otras palabras,\Nesos seis satélites son Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.82,0:16:50.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Am I crazy to think that can't be true?-OG}¿De verdad esperas que me crea esa tontería?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.24,0:16:53.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Being a genius is a pain...-OG}Los genios sí que son un fastidio.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.83,0:17:02.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nuestra misión es devolver a este mocoso\Na Egghead y eliminar a todos los Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.25,0:17:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}El laboratorio está lleno de cosas valiosas.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.71,0:17:07.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Be careful with those while you're at it.-OG}Intenten no dañarlas en el proceso.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.01,0:17:10.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We will eliminate\Nthe handiest man in the world...-OG}Nuestra tarea es eliminar al\Nhombre más útil del mundo.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.55,0:17:15.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Tendrá esto algo que ver con lo que le pasó a Lulusia el otro día?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.39,0:17:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Don't ask questions like that.-WF}No seas entrometido.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.27,0:17:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Not when your intuition is as good as yours.-OG}Eres demasiado astuto para tu propio bien.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.10,0:17:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{She's right!-OG}¡Opino lo mismo!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.65,0:17:26.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Don't get us involved, Lucci!-OG}¡No nos metas en problemas, Lucci!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.90,0:17:30.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Oh, it was so good.-OG}¡Ah, estuvo delicioso!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.45,0:17:34.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Todos se sorprenderán cuando\Nvean la máquina de comida.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's a shame that they aren't here yet to see such a great thing.-OG}Es una lástima que aún no estén aquí.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.55,0:17:38.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's a shame that they aren't here yet to see such a great thing.-OG}¡Esta cosa es la mejor!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.70,0:17:41.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Oh, maybe Sanji will get mad.-OG}Oigan, ¿creen que Sanji se enojará?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.46,0:17:43.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Han comido demasiado!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.21,0:17:46.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{All your stomachs are about to burst!-OG}¡Sus estómagos están a punto de estallar!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.21,0:17:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Mine's always been like this.-OG}No, yo siempre me veo así.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.93,0:17:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I gotta go now.-OG}¡Bueno, me voy volando!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.72,0:17:58.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Are you leaving already?-OG}¡Espera, ¿ya te vas?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.56,0:18:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Mi trabajo es ser violenta!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Qué clase de trabajo es ese?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.74,0:18:20.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What are they?-OG}¿Quiénes son?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.91,0:18:22.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's a lab so...-OG}Bueno, esto es un laboratorio...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.79,0:18:24.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I think they're researchers.-OG}Deben ser investigadores.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.79,0:18:28.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{There wasn't anybody in the town,\Nbut now I see some people...-OG}El pueblo estaba vacío antes,\Npero ahora están saliendo...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.25,0:18:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Maybe they were taking\Nprecautions against us.-OG}Tal vez estaban tomando\Nprecauciones contra nosotros.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.47,0:18:36.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Their outfits look heavy even\Nthough this is a tropical island.-OG}¡¿No es esa ropa algo pesada\Npara una isla tropical?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.80,0:18:37.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Oh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.31,0:18:39.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Dónde está Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.39,0:18:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's Luffy!-OG}Ahí está tu respuesta.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.85,0:18:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.98,0:18:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué estás haciendo?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.48,0:18:48.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Don't take the hat!-OG}¡Cuidado con el sombrero!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.19,0:18:50.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.57,0:18:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Está ahí adentro?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.57,0:18:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Oigan, chicos!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.70,0:18:58.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{How do I look?-OG}¿Qué les parece? ¿Cómo me veo?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.21,0:19:05.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{How funny!-OG}¡Es rarísimo!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.83,0:19:07.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿No es pesado?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.42,0:19:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's really light!-OG}¡De hecho, es muy ligero!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.29,0:19:11.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{And it's cooler inside!-OG}¡Y te mantiene fresco!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.13,0:19:13.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's fashionable.-OG}Qué moderno.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.88,0:19:15.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I wanna wear it, too!-OG}¡Yo también quiero uno!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.26,0:19:16.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿De dónde lo sacaste?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.22,0:19:18.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{This!-OG}¡De esta cosa!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.22,0:19:20.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Nos están dando comida y ropa?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.51,0:19:22.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{This island is awesome!-OG}¡Esta isla es increíble!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.47,0:19:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{To be honest, I feel sticky\Nbecause of the seawater!-OG}¡Para ser honesta, estoy pegajosa por el agua de mar!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.44,0:19:28.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Por favor, seleccione su atuendo preferido.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.69,0:19:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I like?-OG}¿Preferido?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.82,0:19:32.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{A combat dress!-OG}¡Ropa de combate!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.74,0:19:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Puedo quitármelos yo sola!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.54,0:19:47.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Tienes razón!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.25,0:19:48.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They're really light!-OG}¡Son muy ligeros!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.54,0:19:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I feel like I'm floating with these shoes!-OG}¡Estos zapatos me hacen sentir como si flotara!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.00,0:19:52.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Cool!-OG}¡Esto es asombroso!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.71,0:19:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡El futuro!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.80,0:19:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{There was a tropical style one, too.-OG}Incluso tenían estilo tropical.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.38,0:19:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That looks good on you, Jinbe!-OG}¡Te ves genial, Jinbe!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.76,0:20:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Sí? Es perfecto para un disfraz.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.10,0:20:05.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aunque ya saben que estamos aquí.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.77,0:20:11.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'll go find a weapon and track down Vegapunk.-OG}Bueno, iré a buscar un arma\Ny a darle una lección a Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.77,0:20:12.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{So bye.-OG}Nos vemos.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.77,0:20:14.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You must be careful, too!-OG}¡Cuídate mucho, Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.86,0:20:16.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Thanks for everything! - OG}¡Muchas gracias!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.91,0:20:25.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Oye!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.50,0:20:31.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's Kuma!-OG}Es Kuma.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.21,0:20:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Kuma?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.38,0:20:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Is he looking for us? Is it just my imagination?-OG}¡¿Soy yo, o nos está buscando?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.84,0:20:40.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Let's run!-OG}¡Chicos, muévanse!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.55,0:20:42.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.10,0:20:44.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He's gonna run!-OG}¡Va a atacar!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.60,0:20:47.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He's targeting us!-OG}¡Viene por nosotros!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.14,0:20:47.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Oye!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.94,0:20:54.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What's going on?! Explain it to me!-OG}¡¿Qué está pasando?! ¡Pónganme al tanto!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.27,0:20:55.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Sólo sigue corriendo!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.07,0:20:58.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Oh, no!-OG}¡Maldición!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.41,0:21:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Dine and dash! Stealing clothes!-OG}Comer sin pagar.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.01,0:21:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Dine and dash! Stealing clothes!-OG}Robo en tiendas.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.34,0:21:16.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Here comes the laser cannon!-OG}¡Ahí viene el láser!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.93,0:21:25.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡No sabía que tenía que pagar!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.45,0:21:26.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Salió cuando la pateé!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.81,0:21:28.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's vandalism.-OG}Eso es vandalismo, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.86,0:21:37.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{They'd kill us over an eat and run?!-OG}¡¿Van a matarnos por irnos sin pagar?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.48,0:21:39.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's a little too harsh.-OG}Es un poco excesivo.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.62,0:21:46.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If we don't fight back, we'll be in danger!-OG}¡Tenemos que contraatacar o estaremos en problemas!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.28,0:21:50.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{This is a form of self-defense\Nif we put aside the fact that we're pirates!-OG}Podremos ser piratas, pero esto es defensa propia.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.04,0:21:52.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{All right! I feel bad, but...-OG}¡Bien! No quería hacer esto, pero...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.48,0:22:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{All right! I feel bad, but...-OG}{\fad(150,150)}¡Gomu Gomu no...!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.49,0:22:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Esperen!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.17,0:22:36.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Hey! Why did you do that, Bonney?!-OG}¡Oye! ¡¿Por qué hiciste eso, Bonney?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.18,0:22:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He's using laser beams!\NWhy can't I at least punch–-OG}Si va a dispararnos,\Nal menos déjame golpear...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.93,0:22:51.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{He's my father...-OG}Él es mi papá...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.98,0:22:56.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡La única...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.03,0:23:01.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...familia que me queda!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.99,0:23:03.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.62,0:23:11.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Your father who was turned into a cyborg...-OG}Tu papá que fue convertido en un cyborg...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.37,0:23:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Es Kuma?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.31,0:23:34.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Por favor!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.31,0:23:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Don't hurt my father!-OG}¡No lastimen a mi papá!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.19,0:23:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Idiot! Run!-OG}¡Huye, idiota!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.81,0:23:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Es un Pacifista!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.74,0:23:44.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.95,0:23:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.71,0:24:05.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Cierren la válvula dos!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:05.72,0:24:07.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Cover this up!-OG}¡Sellen eso, rápido!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.51,0:24:10.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Aquí también!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.31,0:24:13.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Hay algo justo en frente!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.14,0:24:15.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Turn away!-OG}¡Esquívenlo!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.06,0:24:23.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's impossible, Captain! We can't get away!-OG}¡Es inútil, capitán!\N¡No podemos perderlos!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.62,0:24:39.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I won't let you escape!-OG}¡Como si los fuera a dejar escapar!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.55,0:24:51.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{If we take one more hit, the ship\Nwill be crushed by water pressure!-OG}¡Un golpe más como ese, y la presión del agua aplastará el submarino!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.26,0:24:53.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{We can't get away now!-OG}¡Ya no hay escapatoria!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.56,0:25:00.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Salgamos a la superficie.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.23,0:25:03.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{To the northeast near land!-OG}¡A la orilla más cercana! ¡Hacia el noreste!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.73,0:25:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ¡Sí, capitán!\N– ¡Sí, capitán!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.07,0:25:06.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Diríjanse a tierra firme!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.99,0:25:09.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Todo a estribor!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.45,0:25:17.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Get ready to fight! Hurry up!-OG}¡Prepárense para la batalla! ¡Rápido!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.08,0:25:24.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¿Qué me pasó?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.79,0:25:25.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,De todas formas,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.98,0:25:27.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡estamos en problemas!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.05,0:25:29.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ¡Se ve muy linda, capitana!\N– ¡Se ve muy linda, capitana!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.76,0:25:31.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Cut it out or I'll knock you guys down!-OG}¡Díganlo otra vez y los mataré!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.76,0:25:34.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{– But you're still cute!\N– But you're still cute!-OG}– ¡Pero es la verdad!\N– ¡Pero es la verdad!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.06,0:25:37.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Oh, no!-OG}¡Maldición!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.56,0:25:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Incluso yo...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.02,0:25:43.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Cambiaron mi sexo!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.40,0:25:45.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡No toquen a los infectados!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.36,0:25:47.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,L-Lo siento...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.19,0:25:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{This is infectious!-OG}¡Es una habilidad que propaga enfermedades!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.11,0:25:52.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Your sex will change!-OG}¡Te cambia de sexo!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.03,0:25:57.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{But I learned something in the battle\Nagainst the Emperors of the Sea.-OG}Sin embargo, aprendí algo de mi\Nbatalla contra los Yonkou.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.95,0:25:59.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I can break through it!-OG}¡Es posible anularlo!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.54,0:26:02.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{An over-abundance of haki...-OG}¡Si usas suficiente haki...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.00,0:26:05.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{can nullify devil fruit powers!-OG}...puedes anular los poderes\Nde las frutas del diablo!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.60,0:26:22.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Llegamos a la superficie, capitán!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.56,0:26:25.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I turned back!-OG}¡Estoy curado!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.15,0:26:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bien.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.23,0:26:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Ese es nuestro capitán!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.49,0:26:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No hay tiempo para relajarse.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.65,0:26:35.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Dock the ship! We'll go ashore!-OG}¡Atraquen el barco! ¡Vamos a desembarcar!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.16,0:26:36.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ¡A la orden!\N– ¡A la orden!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.91,0:26:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The disease is cured.-OG}Logró curar la enfermedad, ¿eh?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.54,0:26:48.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Only a man with a 3 billion\Nbounty could do that...-OG}Supongo que hace honor a esa\Nrecompensa de tres mil millones de bellies.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.29,0:26:49.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Así es.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.42,0:26:54.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Los anticuerpos de los curados se\Npropagan igual que la enfermedad.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.14,0:26:59.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I bet you enjoyed it. The feminization disease.-OG}Espero que hayan disfrutado mi\Nenfermedad de feminización.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.19,0:27:05.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Burgess!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.33,0:27:07.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamos a la isla.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.57,0:27:11.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Okay!-OG}¡De acuerdo!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.62,0:27:23.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué?! ¡La montaña se está moviendo!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.25,0:27:26.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Hey! There is someone deep in the island!-OG}¡Oigan! ¡Hay alguien en el interior de la isla!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.35,0:27:43.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's the best! The Strong-Strong Fruit power!-OG}¡Los poderes de esta fruta Riki Riki son los mejores!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.56,0:27:47.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Burgess?!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.19,0:27:50.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{How could he lift up that\Nhumongous, rugged mountain?!-OG}¡¿Cómo está levantando una montaña entera?!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.48,0:27:52.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{When did they come\Nashore in the first place?!-OG}¡¿Cuándo llegaron aquí?!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.57,0:27:55.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That's also a devil fruit power.-OG}Debe ser otra fruta del diablo.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.32,0:27:58.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fuerza sobrehumana,\Ncontagios, teletransportación...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.78,0:28:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{By hunting power-users,\Nthey all obtained ridiculous powers!-OG}¡La caza de frutas del diablo les ha\Nconseguido unos poderes ridículos!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.70,0:28:05.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Con razón sus recompensas\Nsiguen subiendo!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.34,0:28:17.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\\fad(150,150)}¡Room!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.81,0:28:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,109)}¡Amputate!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:57.01,0:29:00.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It's been a while, Trafalgar Law!-OG}¡Cuánto tiempo sin vernos, Trafalgar Law!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:00.72,0:29:02.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Barbanegra!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.68,0:29:03.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué haces aquí?!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:03.93,0:29:05.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Don't be mean!-OG}¡No seas así!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.56,0:29:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Ambos somos miembros de la Peor Generación!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.90,0:29:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Comodoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.02,0:29:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stronger dice que pesas demasiado,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.03,0:29:19.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I feel the same...-OG}y yo opino lo mismo...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:24.70,0:29:27.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Either Straw Hat or Kid or you...-OG}¡Entre Sombrero de Paja, Kid y tú,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.45,0:29:32.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I knew one of you would come\Nhere after departing Wano!-OG}sabía que uno de ustedes vendría\Nhacia aquí desde el País de Wa!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.17,0:29:35.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I can't believe Kaido and Big Mom fell!-OG}¡No puedo creer que Kaidou y Big Mom cayeran!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.34,0:29:37.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡El mundo se ha puesto patas arriba!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.96,0:29:40.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{It feels good!-OG}¡Y me encanta!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.72,0:29:46.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Of course, Kaido had it, didn't he?!-OG}Por supuesto, Kaidou tenía uno,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.03,0:29:47.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Of course, Kaido had it, didn't he?!-OG}¿no es así?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:49.39,0:29:52.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{How many do you have now?-OG}¿Cuántos han encontrado ustedes?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.15,0:29:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡Me llevaré todos tus Road Poneglyph!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.82,0:30:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Conditions are the same for me and you!-OG}¡Digo lo mismo!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.04,0:30:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,¡El ganador...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.04,0:30:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...se lo lleva todo!
