Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:54.58,Translation,,0,0,0,,{}{\pos(960,1060)\c&HD8D5CF&\fad(200,0)\1a&HFF&\}A todos nosotros, les digo una cosa, viajeros:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:57.26,Translation,,0,0,0,,{}{\pos(960,1060)\c&HFFFAF9&\fad(200,0)\1a&HFF&\}No existen las peleas sin sentido.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:00:58.01,Translation,,0,0,0,,{}{\pos(960,1060)\c&HFFFAF9&\fad(0,0)}No existen las peleas sin sentido.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:02.58,Translation,,0,0,0,,{}{\fad(200,200)}Cuando los contextos al azar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:06.51,Translation,,0,0,0,,{}{\c&H2743D4&\fad(200,200)\t(315,315,\c&HE8E8E8&)\t(650,650,\c&HCBEFFD&)\t(984,984,\c&H75DAB7&)\t(1317,1317,\c&HF7F7F7&)\t(2527,2527,\c&H62B6FC&)\t(3236,3486,1,\c&HFFFFFF&)}empiecen a tener sentido por su cuenta,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:12.98,Translation,,0,0,0,,{}{\fad(200,200)}los hilos del tiempo volverán a unirse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.07,0:01:18.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,{}{\c&H8BD6E4&\fad(200,200)\t(1213,1213,\c&H2743D4&)\t(1922,1922,\c&HE8E8E8&)\t(2672,2672,\c&HD5BCFF&)\t(3882,3882,\c&HC2C083&)\t(4299,4299,\c&HB4CAFA&)}El mundo sigue cambiando junto a nosotros.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.25,Translation,,0,0,0,,{}{\c&HB1D6E9&\fad(200,200)}A todos nosotros (a nosotros).
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.87,0:01:26.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,{}{\c&HB1D6E9&\fad(200,0)}Sueño, sálvanos (a nosotros, todos nosotros).
